16:52.141 --> 16:59.368
[SPEAKER_02]: is pretty versatile compared to many other places where where you end up having a bit of a tighter situation with maybe two or three launch spots.

16:59.388 --> 17:08.280
[SPEAKER_02]: We can put 15 gliders on launch or 20 gliders on launch at one time and pretty well have 20 take off in the space of 30 seconds, allowing for

17:08.320 --> 17:18.944
[SPEAKER_02]: traffic. So it's easily done. in that sense. So we're about 10 minutes drive from the nearest little town, which is Manila. And there's pilots

17:18.964 --> 17:26.866
[SPEAKER_02]: going backwards and forwards all the time. So technically you don't need a car when you come here to fly Mount Bora. A lot of the pilots also

17:26.966 --> 17:34.349
